# Configs

Reusable configuration snippets.

Structure:
```
configs/
├── router/
│   ├── base-config.txt
│   ├── ssh-hardening.txt
│   └── routing-ospf.txt
├── switch/
│   ├── base-config.txt
│   ├── vlan-template.txt
│   └── port-security.txt
├── wlan/
│   └── wpa2-enterprise.txt
└── ASA-firewall/
    └── basic-policy.txt
```